{"_note":"商店资料卡 v2:描述 + 「在 App Store 打开 ↗」+ 语言数。截图已拆到上方独立的三格可点行(d-shot.rcn),本卡只剩文字。整卡可点(XPage onClick = `https://${storeTail}` —— 串必须以**字面 scheme** 开头:四端 nav 分类跑在 ${} 插值之前,纯模板 `${storeUrl}` 被判 .notNav 当 .af 读、静默没反应,2026-09-02 真机抓到)。","rc":{"cells":[{"id":"bg","type":"layer","x":"0pt","y":"0pt","w":"{parent.w}","h":"{parent.h}","bgColor":"#FFFFFF|#15171A","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"14pt","leftB":"14pt","rightT":"14pt","rightB":"14pt"}},{"id":"desc","type":"txt","x":"16pt","y":"14pt","w":"{parent.w}-32pt","h":"-1","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${desc},${@i18n.noDesc})]","fontSize":"11pt","lineSpacing":"4pt","textColor":"#0E1116|#F3F4F6","maxLines":"3"},{"id":"open","type":"txt","x":"16pt","y":"74pt","w":"{parent.w}/2","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.open} ↗","fontSize":"11.5pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#0A7AFF|#4DA0FF","maxLines":"1"},{"id":"langs","type":"txt","x":"{parent.w}/2","y":"76pt","w":"{parent.w}/2-16pt","h":"-1","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${langsF},--)] ${@i18n.langs}","fontSize":"10pt","alignmentH":"2","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"}],"i18n":{"zh-CN":{"noDesc":"没有商店描述","open":"在 App Store 打开","langs":"种语言"},"en-US":{"noDesc":"No store description","open":"Open in App Store","langs":"languages"}}}}
